[2026-03-14T22:56:39.435Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0112a6Eo8FZPLSPZrDtDG9Ef","type":"tool_result","content":"  2050→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Add milestone form is visible with \"Draft\" entered.\n  2051→- **Action**: User clicks \"Cancel\".\n  2052→- **Expected**: The form disappears. No new milestone is added. The milestones list remains unchanged.\n  2053→\n  2054→#### Test: Toggle milestone completion status\n  2055→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestone \"Beta Release\" is not completed.\n  2056→- **Action**: User clicks the completion checkbox or toggle for \"Beta Release\".\n  2057→- **Expected**: \"Beta Release\" is marked as completed with a checkmark or completed styling. The change is persisted. An activity entry is created.\n  2058→\n  2059→#### Test: Toggle milestone back to incomplete\n  2060→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestone \"Alpha Release\" is marked as completed.\n  2061→- **Action**: User clicks the completion checkbox or toggle for \"Alpha Release\".\n  2062→- **Expected**: \"Alpha Release\" is marked as incomplete. The completed styling is removed. The change is persisted.\n  2063→\n  2064→#### Test: Delete a milestone with confirmation\n  2065→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestone \"Alpha Release\" exists.\n  2066→- **Action**: User clicks a delete button on the \"Alpha Release\" milestone.\n  2067→- **Expected**: A confirmation dialog appears (e.g., \"Are you sure you want to delete this milestone?\"). The milestone is not yet deleted.\n  2068→\n  2069→#### Test: Confirm milestone deletion\n  2070→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestone delete confirmation dialog is showing for \"Alpha Release\".\n  2071→- **Action**: User clicks \"Confirm\" or \"Delete\" in the dialog.\n  2072→- **Expected**: \"Alpha Release\" is removed from the milestones list. The change is persisted. An activity entry is created.\n  2073→\n  2074→#### Test: Cancel milestone deletion\n  2075→- **Initial state**: Milestone delete confirmation dialog is showing for \"Alpha Release\".\n  2076→- **Action**: User clicks \"Cancel\" in the dialog.\n  2077→- **Expected**: The dialog closes. \"Alpha Release\" remains in the milestones list unchanged.\n  2078→\n  2079→#### Test: Edit milestone name inline\n  2080→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestone \"Beta Release\" exists.\n  2081→- **Action**: User clicks on the milestone name \"Beta Release\", changes it to \"Public Beta\", and confirms.\n  2082→- **Expected**: The milestone name updates to \"Public Beta\". The change is persisted.\n  2083→\n  2084→#### Test: Edit milestone target date\n  2085→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestone \"Beta Release\" has target date \"Apr 1, 2026\".\n  2086→- **Action**: User clicks the target date for \"Beta Release\" and selects \"Apr 15, 2026\".\n  2087→- **Expected**: The target date updates to \"Apr 15, 2026\". The change is persisted.\n  2088→\n  2089→#### Test: Milestones section shows empty state when no milestones\n  2090→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Project has no milestones.\n  2091→- **Expected**: A friendly empty state message is shown (e.g., \"No milestones yet. Add one to track progress.\") with an \"Add Milestone\" button.\n  2092→\n  2093→#### Test: Key metrics section displays project statistics\n  2094→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Project has 10 total issues: 6 Done, 1 In Progress, 2 Todo, 1 Backlog.\n  2095→- **Expected**: The key metrics section displays: total issues (10), completed issues (6), in-progress issues (1), remaining issues (4 — Todo + Backlog + In Progress), and completion percentage (60%).\n  2096→\n  2097→#### Test: Key metrics update when issue statuses change\n  2098→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab showing 6/10 completed (60%). User switches to Issues tab.\n  2099→- **Action**: User changes an issue from \"In Progress\" to \"Done\" on the Issues tab, then switches back to the Overview tab.\n  2100→- **Expected**: Key metrics now show 7/10 completed (70%). The completed count increased by 1 and the remaining count decreased by 1.\n  2101→\n  2102→#### Test: Key metrics handle project with zero issues\n  2103→- **Initial state**: User is viewing a project with 0 issues, Overview tab.\n  2104→- **Expected**: Key metrics show: total issues 0, completed 0, remaining 0, completion percentage 0% or \"N/A\". No errors occur.\n  2105→\n  2106→## Members Page (`/settings/members`)\n  2107→\n  2108→**Components**: MemberList, InviteMemberModal, MemberActions\n  2109→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019JuAqhnvU9KW4kFSamcC4c","session_id":"9d79f14e-e24f-460a-9e3f-21530b576549","uuid":"a39f22e1-0004-47c9-95cf-17f3a1a97fa8"}
