[2026-03-14T22:56:40.813Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WZdD4LKmVhmhTNhohApnHE","type":"tool_result","content":"  1950→- **Action**: User clicks the status icon on the issue row.\n  1951→- **Expected**: A dropdown opens showing all status options: Backlog, Todo, In Progress, In Review, Done, Cancelled — each with its distinct icon and color.\n  1952→\n  1953→#### Test: Change issue status from issue row\n  1954→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Issues tab. Issue status dropdown is open for \"ENG-42\" (currently \"Todo\").\n  1955→- **Action**: User selects \"In Progress\" from the dropdown.\n  1956→- **Expected**: The status icon updates to the yellow half-circle \"In Progress\" icon. The dropdown closes. The change is persisted. The project progress bar in the header updates if the status changed to/from Done.\n  1957→\n  1958→#### Test: Issues tab shows empty state when project has no issues\n  1959→- **Initial state**: User is viewing a project that has 0 issues, with the Issues tab active.\n  1960→- **Expected**: A friendly empty state message is displayed (e.g., \"No issues in this project yet.\") with an appropriate icon.\n  1961→\n  1962→#### Test: Team groups are collapsible\n  1963→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Issues tab. Issues are grouped by teams \"Engineering\" and \"Design\".\n  1964→- **Action**: User clicks the \"Engineering\" team header.\n  1965→- **Expected**: The Engineering group collapses, hiding its issues. The Design group remains expanded. Clicking the Engineering header again expands it back.\n  1966→\n  1967→#### Test: Issue checkboxes enable bulk selection\n  1968→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Issues tab. Multiple issues are displayed.\n  1969→- **Action**: User clicks the checkbox on issue \"ENG-42\" and \"ENG-43\".\n  1970→- **Expected**: Both issues are visually selected (highlighted row or checked checkbox). A bulk actions toolbar appears at the top showing the count of selected issues (e.g., \"2 selected\").\n  1971→\n  1972→#### Test: Bulk action — change status for multiple issues\n  1973→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Issues tab. Issues \"ENG-42\" and \"ENG-43\" are selected via checkboxes. Bulk actions toolbar is visible.\n  1974→- **Action**: User clicks the \"Status\" bulk action button and selects \"Done\".\n  1975→- **Expected**: Both issues update their status to \"Done\" with green check-circle icons. The changes are persisted. The project progress bar in the header updates to reflect the new completion count. Activity entries are created for each issue.\n  1976→\n  1977→#### Test: Bulk action — change priority for multiple issues\n  1978→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Issues tab. Issues \"ENG-42\" and \"ENG-43\" are selected. Bulk actions toolbar is visible.\n  1979→- **Action**: User clicks the \"Priority\" bulk action button and selects \"Urgent\".\n  1980→- **Expected**: Both issues update their priority to \"Urgent\" with red alert-triangle icons. The changes are persisted.\n  1981→\n  1982→#### Test: Bulk action — change assignee for multiple issues\n  1983→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Issues tab. Issues \"ENG-42\" and \"ENG-43\" are selected. Bulk actions toolbar is visible.\n  1984→- **Action**: User clicks the \"Assignee\" bulk action button and selects \"Bob Jones\".\n  1985→- **Expected**: Both issues update their assignee to \"Bob Jones\". The changes are persisted.\n  1986→\n  1987→#### Test: Bulk action — change label for multiple issues\n  1988→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Issues tab. Issues \"ENG-42\" and \"ENG-43\" are selected. Bulk actions toolbar is visible.\n  1989→- **Action**: User clicks the \"Label\" bulk action button and selects \"Feature\".\n  1990→- **Expected**: Both issues have the \"Feature\" label added. The changes are persisted.\n  1991→\n  1992→#### Test: Deselect all clears bulk selection\n  1993→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Issues tab. 2 issues are selected and bulk toolbar is showing.\n  1994→- **Action**: User clicks a \"Deselect all\" button or unchecks both checkboxes.\n  1995→- **Expected**: All issue selections are cleared. The bulk actions toolbar disappears.\n  1996→\n  1997→#### Test: Changing status to Done updates project progress bar\n  1998→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1` with 10 issues, 5 completed. Progress bar shows 50%.\n  1999→- **Action**: User clicks the status icon on an issue currently marked \"In Progress\" and selects \"Done\"."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019JuAqhnvU9KW4kFSamcC4c","session_id":"9d79f14e-e24f-460a-9e3f-21530b576549","uuid":"f669b1b8-e3e0-44e9-9157-1441dbc66bcf"}
